WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.059
Sampan moves stablecoins in and out of Bitcoin

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:05.912
Cash, from the wallet you already use.

00:00:10.619 --> 00:00:12.906
Every number on this page is counted from

00:00:12.999 --> 00:00:14.520
mainnet transactions.

00:00:14.845 --> 00:00:18.168
Anyone can open each one in a block explorer.

00:00:26.519 --> 00:00:28.423
Paste your address and you get a landing

00:00:28.469 --> 00:00:29.015
address.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.999
Any wallet can pay it with plain BCH.

00:00:32.382 --> 00:00:35.226
A contract turns the coins into PUSD for you,

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.785
or gives them back.

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:54.338
Or connect a Bitcoin Cash wallet with

00:00:54.408 --> 00:00:55.302
WizardConnect.

00:00:55.813 --> 00:00:59.017
One signature swaps BCH for PUSD through

00:00:59.087 --> 00:01:00.460
Cauldron pools.

00:01:12.296 --> 00:01:14.850
Stablecoins on other chains come in too.

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:17.880
Here, USDC on Avalanche goes through

00:01:17.962 --> 00:01:18.809
THORChain.

00:01:19.134 --> 00:01:22.652
It lands at a landing address as BCH, and the

00:01:22.699 --> 00:01:25.148
contract turns it into PUSD.

00:01:25.473 --> 00:01:27.935
The wait is cut, and the clock in the corner

00:01:28.028 --> 00:01:29.746
keeps the real time.

00:02:03.693 --> 00:02:06.270
It works on a phone too, and every crossing

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:08.944
links to the explorers of both chains.

00:02:18.185 --> 00:02:19.504
Try it at sampan.

00:02:19.582 --> 00:02:20.358
sasateguh.

00:02:20.435 --> 00:02:20.823
com.
